    <!-- About / help card -->
    <string name="ai_about_title">What is TAG Assistant?</string>
    <string name="ai_about_body">TAG Assistant is an AI companion living inside your project editor.

• Chat mode answers questions about your app, explains layouts and suggests events.
• Agent mode can perform actions for you: build the project, open managers, adjust files — always asking before anything destructive.

Your API key stays on this device, encrypted. The assistant only talks to the provider you choose and can be turned off at any time.</string>
    <string name="ai_about_privacy">Privacy: keys are stored locally with EncryptedSharedPreferences. Nothing is sent anywhere except your own provider.</string>

